{"articleNo":"61130","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=61130&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"특허 맵(전략보고서)작성실습 강좌","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.08.10","hit":"3487","attachments":[{"name":"특허맵신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=61130&attachNo=70866"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">특허 맵의 이해 및 실습강좌 개설&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 배경 및 목적</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.&nbsp;그동안 특허교육에 참여한 학생들을 대상으로&nbsp;성공적인 특허 및 지재권 창출을 위해</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;기술개발 초기단계에서부터 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">특허 맵을 작성할 필요가 있음</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나.&nbsp;단순한 이론강좌가 아니라 실습을 위주로 학생 스스로가 특허 맵을 작성할 수 있는 능</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 력을</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;함양시켜&nbsp;특허유니버시아드 대회나 특허기술사업화를 지원하고자 함&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2. 강좌일정</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; <strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">가. 교육기간 : 8. 23(목) ~ 9. 20(목) 기간중&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; 나. 수업시간 :&nbsp;매주 목요일 총 5회 16:00~20:00 (1회 4시간)</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다.&nbsp;강의실 : 이오스관 210호</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 교육과정</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;교육인원 : 6팀[20명내외 (접수순 마감)] 1팀은 2명이상&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;내용</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 1회차 : 특허맵의 이해(정보조사, 맵 작성방법)</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2회차 :&nbsp;주제별 팀원구성</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 3회차&nbsp;: 특허맵 작성 중간검토 및 개인지도</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 4회차 : 최종점검 및 지도</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 5회차 : 팀별 발표 및 시상</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; 다. 강사 : 변리사 및 특허분석 전문가</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">4. 신청방법</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; <font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>가. 신청기간 : 8. 20(월) 18:00 이메일 접수 </strong></font><a href=\"mailto:ygchoi@kumoh.ac.kr\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>ygchoi@kumoh.ac.kr</strong></font></a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; 나. 수강시 준비사항(전제조건)</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - <font color=\"#ff007f\"><strong>특허맵을 작성하기 위한 기술주제 확보</strong></font></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학생 스스로의; 아이디어에 대한 특허맵 작성</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 기업이나 교수님으로 부터 의뢰받은&nbsp;기술주제&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 주제별 팀 구성</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; 다. 문의 교내 7232 산학협력단</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
